                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "98c916f3-283f-4a51-9a92-afc28dd89c9a",
                                "sense_id": "0beb9069-39c9-39bf-917d-eb1fb96176b9",
                                "text": "Bis zur zehnten Klasse hatte ich immer Sportlehrer, die vom Typ her Unteroffiziere waren. Da habe ich mich verweigert und war in diesen Jahren eher der klassische Turnbeutelvergesser.",
                                "translation": "Until the tenth grade, I always had physical education teachers who acted like non-commissioned officers. So I refused and was more of a classic P.E. refusenik during those years.",
